    <string name="tpl_delete_body">This cannot be undone. If it is in use, the app switches back to the compact built-in template.</string>
    <string name="tpl_footnote_builtin">Built-in templates cannot be renamed or deleted. Choose “Copy as custom” first; changes stay in the copy.</string>
    <string name="tpl_footnote_custom">The preview shows the first %1$d lines. Tap “Edit” to read and change the whole text.</string>
    <string name="tpl_blurb_lite">The default template in clause style: framing, contact, limbs, dressing and de-duplication are all covered, with the fewest words, so the same image comes out faster and cheaper. Use it for everyday batches.</string>
    <string name="tpl_blurb_long">The full manual, with counter-examples and reasoning. An extra layer of why-this-would-fail keeps drafts with many characters, complex poses and awkward locations from going wrong, so there is less rework. The cost is about 4x the context per call: slower, and more expensive.</string>

